Starbucks has reported its first quarter of positive global same-store sales since 2023. The Seattle-based coffee chain’s same-store sales were up 1% systemwide after six straight quarters of declines, while U.S. same-store sales were flat, for the fourth quarter of 2025, ended Sept. 28.&nbsp;

