Ahead of Starbucks’ third-quarter earnings release, a group of Starbucks investors — Strategic Organizing Center (SOC) Investment Group — sent a letter to the company’s executive board directors criticizing Starbucks for both its ongoing financial challenges and alleged labor law violations.&nbsp;

